  "instructions": [
    "heat the ghee or oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "add the minced garlic and grated ginger; cook for 1 minute.",
    "add the cumin, coriander, salt, and black pepper; cook for 1 minute.",
    "add the dried fava beans, buckwheat flour, and water; bring to a boil.",
    "reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, until the fava beans are tender, about 20-25 minutes.",
    "use an immersion blender to puree the soup until smooth.",
    "add the crumbled feta cheese and stir until melted and well combined.",
    "taste and adjust seasoning as needed.",
    "serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
